        <body>&lt;p&gt;Dear Safeforce1 users,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Greetings for the day!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;To add an extra layer of protection against threats like phishing attacks, increase the security of our safeforce1 app. We request you to enable Multi-factor authentication (MFA) in your login process before 31st January.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Please &lt;a href=&quot;https://safeforce1--c.ind23.visual.sfdc-y37hzm.force.com/resource/1641886292000/MFA_Doc&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;download &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;this document for the complete guide on how to enable MFA.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;for any help and query related to MFA please contact Mr. Sunny Jhalani on &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(13, 0, 169);&quot;&gt;sunny.jhalani@safexpress.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Note: Users without MFA enabled are not able to log in after 31st Jan 2022.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have a Nice Day,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Team Safeforce1 &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</body>
